        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you know history? Prove it. Boffins History Quiz Reel is a fast-paced trivia challenge that separates the enthusiasts from the experts. Climb the leaderboards, unlock achievements, and face a new barrage of questions every time you play. Have what it takes? Wishlist now and prepare for battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Never the Same Quiz Twice:</strong> A massive, randomized pool of questions. </i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Climb the Ranks:</strong> It's not just about being right; it's about being fast and consistent. Fight for the top spot on the global leaderboards.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Unlock Your Achievements:</strong> Earn bragging rights by conquering specific historical eras and acing difficult categories.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Knowledge is Power:</strong> Every question you answer—right or wrong—helps you learn fascinating new details about our shared past.</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Features:</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Full Controller, Mouse, and Keyboard Support</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Leader-boards </i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dozens of Achievements to Unlock</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A Growing Library of Challenging Questions</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You've watched the documentaries and read the books. Now, it's time to put your knowledge to the ultimate test. <strong>Wishlist Boffins History Quiz Reel today!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Game Launch 30% discount for a short period, to get the quiz trivia started.</p>",
